        "SSR:/blogs/strategy-snapshot-trading-breakouts"
      ],
      "translation": "准备好将低流动性的日子转化为高利润的潜力了吗？不要让劣质工具破坏您的努力。利用专为认真开展业务的交易者打造的尖端实时外汇交易平台来增强您的能力。无论您是在迪拜的摩天大楼里还是在深夜的办公桌前，您都应该拥有一个能够提供闪电般快速执行、实时图表、可定制警报和机构级可靠性的平台。采取下一步：探索我们平台的免费演示，看看我们的高级功能如何增强您的突破策略。"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf706b3d20bb44780",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Why Spreads Matter in Forex Trading</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/best-forex-trading-platform#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/best-forex-trading-platform"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">为什么点差在外汇交易中很重要</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tda5d581708c64cbf",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">In forex, the </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">spread</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">—the gap between the bid and ask price—represents your immediate trading cost. Lower spreads reduce your upfront expense and improve profitability, especially for scalpers and high-frequency traders (</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">Exness</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">, Myfxbook</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"5\">). Tight spreads also minimize slippage and enhance execution quality, allowing you to capture small market moves with confidence (</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"6\">Exness</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"7\">).</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/best-forex-trading-platform#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/best-forex-trading-platform"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">在外汇交易中，</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">点差</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">（买价和卖价之间的差距）代表您的即时交易成本。较低的点差可减少您的前期费用并提高盈利能力，特别是对于剥头皮交易者和高频交易者（</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">Exness</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">、Myfxbook</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"5\">）。低点差还可以最大限度地减少滑点并提高执行质量，让您能够自信地捕捉市场的小幅波动 (</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"6\">Exness</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"7\">)。</span>"
    },
