    {
      "key": "t09d95a15a9fde629",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Jumping into real-money trading can feel like diving into the deep end without learning to swim. For </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">forex trading for beginners</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">, a demo account is your life jacket. UpForex’s demo mirrors its live engine—real-time prices, identical spreads, charting tools, and order types—using a virtual </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">₹10,000</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\"> balance. Below, we’ll compare demo vs. live trading, show you exactly how to leverage UpForex’s demo, walk you through signup, and point you toward the next step: trading with confidence.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/why-starting-with-a-demo-is-key-a-beginner#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/why-starting-with-a-demo-is-key-a-beginner"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">直接进行真实资金交易，就像没有学会游泳便跳入深水区。对于</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">外汇交易初学者</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">，模拟账户就是救生衣。UpForex模拟账户反映真实交易引擎的实时价格、相同点差、图表工具及订单类型，使用虚拟的</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">₹10,000</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">余额。下面将比较模拟与真实交易，具体说明如何利用UpForex模拟账户、逐步注册，并迈向下一步：自信交易。</span>"
    },
