    },
    {
      "key": "t842c86ffaf6f7fb9",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">Q1: How long should I demo trade before going live?</span></span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/why-starting-with-a-demo-is-key-a-beginner#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/why-starting-with-a-demo-is-key-a-beginner"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">Q1: 模拟交易需要多长时间才能上线？</span></span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t0f3620a9d486eac5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"> Aim for </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">1–2 weeks</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> or </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">15–30 demo trades</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">, targeting small, consistent gains with ≤1% risk per trade.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/why-starting-with-a-demo-is-key-a-beginner#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/why-starting-with-a-demo-is-key-a-beginner"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">以</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">1–2周</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">或</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">15–30笔模拟交易</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">为目标，争取小而稳定的收益，每笔交易风险≤1%。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t85675ab1b3b14979",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">Q2: Can I use Expert Advisors (EAs) on demo?</span></span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/why-starting-with-a-demo-is-key-a-beginner#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/why-starting-with-a-demo-is-key-a-beginner"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">Q2：我可以在演示中使用智能交易系统 (EA) 吗？</span></span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t6dd10ef317350193",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">Q3: Do demo spreads match live?</span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\"></span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\"> UpForex mirrors live spreads and execution speeds in demo. Only extreme volatility may cause minor variances.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/why-starting-with-a-demo-is-key-a-beginner#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/why-starting-with-a-demo-is-key-a-beginner"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">问题 3：演示点差与实时点差相符吗？</span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\"></span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\"> UpForex 反映了演示中的实时点差和执行速度。只有极端的波动才可能导致微小的差异。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t0a9648e927dc3ec1",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">Q4: How do I bridge demo success to live profits?</span></span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/why-starting-with-a-demo-is-key-a-beginner#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/why-starting-with-a-demo-is-key-a-beginner"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">问题 4：如何将演示成功与实际利润联系起来？</span></span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t7becfc7f59dbf3c3",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">Ready to Trade Smarter?</span></span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/why-starting-with-a-demo-is-key-a-beginner#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/why-starting-with-a-demo-is-key-a-beginner"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">准备好进行更智能的交易了吗？</span></span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1c851ae0ddc8b0c8",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">For </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">forex trading for beginners</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">, the smartest path is clear: </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">demo first, live later</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/why-starting-with-a-demo-is-key-a-beginner#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/why-starting-with-a-demo-is-key-a-beginner"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">对</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">外汇交易初学者</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">而言，最明智的路径很清楚：</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">先模拟，再进行真实交易</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t656ab01558eb565d",
      "english": "With over $7.5 trillion changing hands daily, the foreign currency (forex or FX) market is currently the largest financial marketplace in the world, with almost $850 million being transacted every second. Thanks to easily accessible online platforms, everyday investors can now participate in what was formerly the sole domain of banks and hedge funds.",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-start-forex-trading-for-beginners#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-start-forex-trading-for-beginners"
      ],
      "translation": "外汇（forex或FX）市场目前是全球最大的金融市场，每日交易额超过$7.5万亿，几乎每秒交易$850百万。借助容易使用的在线平台，普通投资者现在也可以参与此前仅属于银行和对冲基金的领域。"
    },
    {
      "key": "t3f1c736fe57814d3",
      "english": "Fundamentally, <span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">forex trading</span></span> entails purchasing one currency and selling another at the same time in an effort to profit from changes in their relative prices. For example, you would purchase EUR/USD now and sell it later at a higher rate if you think the euro will gain value relative to the US dollar. This Forex Trading for Beginners will equip you with the essentials—from understanding currency pairs and market hours to placing your first demo trade—so you can start your journey with confidence.",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-start-forex-trading-for-beginners#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-start-forex-trading-for-beginners"
      ],
      "translation": "从根本上来说，<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">外汇交易</span></span>需要同时购买一种货币并出售另一种货币，以从其相对价格的变化中获利。例如，如果您认为欧元相对于美元会升值，您可以现在购买欧元/美元，然后以更高的价格出售。本外汇交易初学者课程将为您提供从了解货币对和市场交易时间到进行首次模拟交易的基本知识，以便您可以充满信心地开始您的旅程。"
    }
  ]
